# Deep Ocean 50 MP3s (811 MB) are served locally from public/audio/deep-ocean/ and uploaded to Cloudflare R2 via scripts/upload-r2.mjs
public/audio/deep-ocean/*.mp3
*.gdoc
Assets/**/*.zip
